'''Thundering Berserkir Axes''' are the upgraded form of [[Berserkir Axes]] using the [[Iolite]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Iolite]], they gain 10 [[Lightning|lightning damage]] and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply [[Chain Lightning]].

* Its primary attack is a 4-step combo: two single hits, one with each axe, followed by two double hits using both axes simultaneously, resulting in a total of 6 hits. The final double hit deals 2x damage with each individual hit.
* The secondary attack costs 32 stamina and is a leap forward, followed by a slash with both axes for a single hit, dealing 2x the damage.

An upgraded Berserkir Axes will '''NOT''' keep their upgrade level when they are crafted into Thundering Berserkir Axes.

